column2:
The documentation states that students must have "successful completion of 200 credit points" as a requirement for enrolling in Discovery Project. In most academic systems, subjects are typically worth 10 credit points each, meaning 200 credit points would correspond to 20 subjects. Since "multiple" implies more than one subject, and students need to have completed 200 credit points (which is more than one subject), the answer to the question "Do I need to complete multiple subjects before taking Discovery Project?" is yes.

Additionally, the documentation specifies that COMP3032 (Machine Learning) is a co-requisite that must be completed before enrolling in Discovery Project, further confirming that at least one additional subject is required. Combined with the 200 credit points requirement, students need to complete multiple subjects before taking Discovery Project.

\boxed{Yes}
